config ZMS_FIXTURES_BUSY
	bool "Write the busy settings store instead"
	help
	  Kite Rush's geometry (16 sectors of 4 KiB) and a few thousand
	  settings writes, enough to wrap round the store and collect garbage.
	  A demo image for screenshots, too big to keep as a test fixture.

source "Kconfig.zephyr"
